  "body": "Positioned on tightly held Ewen Street, this 615sqm (approx.) freehold site presents a rare and compelling opportunity in one of Takapuna's most desirable streets. With resource and building consent already in place to build up to three levels, along with the advantage of two legal road frontage access points (further information available upon request), the property offers outstanding scope to redevelop and maximise its full potential.\r\n\r\nSet in an elevated, north-facing position capturing excellent sun, the site is just moments from the golden sands of Takapuna Beach. Currently home to a charming 1920s bungalow, buyers may also consider options to renovate or landbank while planning for the future. The existing home retains its character appeal and offers four bedrooms, two bathrooms, and sun-soaked decking, providing comfortable living or rental income while future plans are considered.\r\n\r\nConveniently located with easy access to Esmonde Road for a quick commute to Auckland CBD, and within walking distance to Takapuna Village's vibrant shops, cafes, and amenities. Zoned for Takapuna Grammar School and Westlake Girls High School.",
